1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Starting with a small boat, the system iterates on assets, routes and review methods.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Assets must satisfy size, source and gameplay constraints—not just download successfully.

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:32,000
Three component types are evaluated. An invalid candidate is rolled back; retained methods are reused.

4
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:42,000
The new connector retrieves 666,655 bytes within a 700,000-byte budget, with traceable sources.

5
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Restore the same saved state to compare the workshop across two product releases.

6
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:56,000
The new view reveals centerline parts. Product revisions and capability evolution are recorded separately.

7
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Sail, refit and edit routes. Retained methods support the next round of content.

8
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Adoption and reuse are recorded. Experience conclusions come from builder self-play.
